NEUTRONSYNC RELEASE SIGNING KEY PLACEHOLDER

This file is embedded into neutronsync-gui at build time and is not a key yet.
Until the public half of the release signing key replaces it, a build made from
this tree refuses to install any release from 0.7.0 on, because it cannot
verify one. Follow docs/RELEASE_SIGNING.md to create the key and put the
armored public key here in place of this text.
